+    "why": "The ownership check is registered with router.use('/invoices/:id'), but Router.compile anchors every pattern with ^...$ (src/router.js:13), so it only matches the exact path /invoices/:id and never /invoices/:id/pdf. getInvoicePdf (src/invoices.js:25) looks the invoice up by id and checks only that it exists, not who owns it. Alice gets 200 with a base64 PDF of Bob's inv_1002 (customer cust_bob, Consulting 990.00, total 990.00)."
